{"id":"vod_sn_36704","vodId":"36704","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黑骸","name_cn":"黑骸","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/502ba957fc280fe7affb6e7444485074.jpg"},"summary":"立山国际高中的白羽由希奈，在三人面谈后追赶暴风雨般离开的母亲·洋海为了送还遗忘的智能手机，朋友荻布美夏也一起到母亲的工作场所黑部研究所去。在大厅里顺利的把智能手机交给了母亲，相识的研究人员、荒俣稔等人说着的话的时候突然火球飞来了，产生的冲击波将研究所的窗户玻璃震碎了。在警报鸣响的研究所地基内，身份不明的侵略者同警备员们展开战斗，打算到地下避难的由希奈的目光停留在了实验室里方块发出的奇怪的光上。　　立山黑部峡谷在修筑大坝时发现神秘的遗迹。为研究“Artifact”设立了国际联合黑部研究所。世界各国的首脑聚集在研究所员的孩子就读的立山国际高中。研究所长的女儿、白羽由希奈也在这里上学。那是2016年的夏天、一名武士再一次苏醒。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iqU4Njg1D91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rwv1DBUnHH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jeUwSQWLT11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kS80WTnrkV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s2e4QsqR6s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RxibJFxmY01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WCEicGJwxq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T6RVtEWkie1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kU3XSCXXL51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ce0yJ0XuvE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aURG5r06Uw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wP9xx4iPjt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Ynynyem111/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JtxBaQBRYh1/video/index